{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "5f760efcb07e66018902f8cb662b0827f64b42b0f5d72d51b93f23ab80789c31", "ja": "お姫さまたちの憧れ！", "zh": "公主们的憧憬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f9de480ad2259e4260517308070bb70649e71699dd4bc71fb2468a4b16b3728e", "ja": "Princessチームお披露目公演当日。\nオープニングナンバーを歌う未来達は、\nこれまでの合宿に思いを馳せ意欲を燃やす。\nお姫様がいつか夢をかなえ、美しいクイーン\nになるため、いざ、本番のステージへ！", "zh": "Princess队首次亮相公演当天。\n准备演唱开场曲目的未来等人，\n想起了集训时的种种，全身充满了干劲。\n为了终有一天能成就公主的美梦，\n蜕变成美丽的女王，是时候正式登台了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1e7d60b3a13d907704b7fd0dbff59dfb17c4b0ec57ff7833b713211ac594a429", "ja": "（いよいよPrincessの公演が始まる。\nファンの熱気がここまで伝わってくるぞ！）", "zh": "（Princess的公演终于要开始了。\n粉丝的热情都传到这里来了呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "422117a92324913f297140271c410c189992c428d61f324f2872c837d83e632a", "ja": "ふり返ると、あっという間だった気がするけど……。\nえへへ、とうとう本番だね、未来。", "zh": "现在回想起来，感觉那些日子一下就过去了……\n嘿嘿，终于要登台了呢，未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "1e0e9c6bdef5431313e8d5e1cb98e674a9369dd34e50a15aec8d3073718f3851", "ja": "合宿でいっぱい練習したこと、やっと見てもらえるね！\nえへへ、頑張らなくちゃ♪", "zh": "终于能展现集训时努力练习的成果了！\n嘿嘿，我们要加油才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "aafa4b7c87795dd8d639d267ce90c2c4a6ab7442e28320b19052e8b078b3ec7a", "ja": "なんだか、まだ合宿が続いてるみたいだよね。\nだってステージの上でも、みんなと一緒だもん！", "zh": "总觉得我们的集训好像还没结束呢。\n因为就算站上舞台，我们也都和彼此同在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "ff34fe5398cf6fb3c834f3f52a5f2f891ed813de5fa34dc0ab10d3872b576ef9", "ja": "でも、この公演が終わって、家に帰ったら……。\n私、みなさんのことが恋しくなってしまいそうです。", "zh": "不过，等公演结束，回到家以后……\n我好像就会开始思念起大家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "b57a6ea403992a0e5467c8097350ca5ba8d768289619d202a5a0b0a853b8af1e", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、これで終わりじゃないのですよ？\n姫たちのステージは、ここからがスタートなのです！", "zh": "小艾蜜莉，这还不是终点啊，\n公主我们的舞台，才正要开始的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4a6a545e376cb334b5c8bc95140cc910f59876b4797aef709af26b8fac4ef61b", "ja": "そうだな。それに今回の合宿で、\nみんなもずいぶん成長したと思う。", "zh": "说得对，而且我觉得透过这次的集训，\n大家确实有了显著的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5fcb3c6ab5636a4cc134b2c3290a9a2f9a3e7fb46073ac57d37dcd358a639a9f", "ja": "何より、目の輝きが変わったかな。\nこれからのみんなが楽しみだよ！", "zh": "我想最重要的是，大家的眼神不一样了。\n我很看好你们今后的表现喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "bd1f0f3e24f7816905fe12a0918058304d0ec8023bc4978b1a0378c0b149a387", "ja": "でへへ～、ほんとですか～？\n可奈、私の目、見て見て！", "zh": "嘿嘿～真的吗～？\n可奈，快看我的眼睛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "b786091f89ada05dc9788f31b0e618c032381922839e87a9208fdc88aea2e87d", "ja": "あっ、ほんとにキラキラしてるかも！\n百合子ちゃんのも、見せて見せて！", "zh": "啊！好像真的在闪闪发光耶！\n百合子的眼睛也让我看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "22a2ade5141c066a0887dc8a56eb019d9cc6f79c92e90338d576d7d35621e30c", "ja": "わ、私の目は、ちょっと寝不足だから見ないで……！\nだって、やっぱり緊張してて……。", "zh": "我、我昨天有点失眠，不要看我的眼睛……\n结果我还是紧张过头……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "f1bd9487ef191932ae3f62678c7b26f06e4547c96cce3baee9dcd1b962acdfaa", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、今日の舞台、精いっぱい頑張りますね。\n素敵な合宿を、本当にありがとうございました！", "zh": "策划执行人先生，今天的舞台，我会尽力演出的。\n真的很感谢您帮我们安排了那么棒的集训！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "fb9150e931cb13890559f6b4ff52908765ccf654aff311943830e15e4fdb2ea0", "ja": "まつりも、とっても楽しかったのです。\n{$P$}さん、わんだほー！なのです♪", "zh": "茉莉也过得非常开心。\n{$P$}先生，真是美妙的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "96e602afe7d2f96b54b08fbdc137075056db78ba9dab0e0d82d80f8ccb76ea5d", "ja": "5人とも、準備は万端ってところだな\nオープニングナンバーが、今から楽しみだよ。", "zh": "看来你们五人都已经做好万全准备了。\n我已经开始期待开场歌曲啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "7d2a7392a4a930752e6ef17bb750bb111ee13d7e4d546adec9e9d1c40cedbffc", "ja": "はいっ、私もわくわくしてますっ！\n早くステージで歌いたいな～♪", "zh": "嗯！我也很期待！\n好想赶快上台唱歌喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "016b362d36a90d796d23233dd444a4c171e30c0b2bbb5709c640d8b26e14eed8", "ja": "そうだよねっ。あの広いステージを、\nいっぱい、い～っぱい！　駆け回りたいです♪", "zh": "就是啊！好想在那么宽敞的舞台，\n左跑、右跑！尽～情四处跑跳♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "051c5d1b73e269388abf940f62f69f5eece7f7045033c820168d7ef1bbb5410e", "ja": "お客さんも、姫たちのパーティーを、\n今か今かとみんな待っているのです♪", "zh": "观众也早已迫不及待\n在等公主我们开始这场派对了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "47a4f361254dbe861bf3d1e152dd3d7f01736d6fd88ff8cca82f4216b5086154", "ja": "足を運んでいただいたごヒイキ様方に、来てよかったと\n思っていただけるよう、誠心誠意、つとめます！", "zh": "为了让特地前来的主顾们尽兴而归，\n我会诚心诚意努力表演的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "0e3ca97052718ba2dad934ba0e8ac94e7e93db28820fb46cbf145ba4c0e3324f", "ja": "物語を読み進めるかどうかは、最初の1ページ次第。\n……オープニングナンバー、絶対に成功させようね！", "zh": "会不会继续读一本书，在翻开第一页的时候就决定了。\n……开场歌曲，我们一定要让它成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a8cfe0f22e8f83b689c020d7e55b3ddc0660ccf25aa354866b2d80e32133869d", "ja": "よし、そろそろ時間だ。最後の幕が下りるまで、\nお客さんと一緒に楽しんでこい！", "zh": "好，时间差不多了。在最后的布幕落下以前，\n去和观众好好享受演出吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "aea72bc100d182a9d2b3f8649daa016b26a56b7f3ce451a63a791a686bedb5c3", "ja": "はいっ！（なのです！）", "zh": "好！（的喔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "84fec0b04b4f4bc30492ba3d22838f0ebbfbf474add6410aae38a6fe7339d053", "ja": "はいなのです！", "zh": "好的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "2aa00c9f395440a1f07f64f8f0f2da923bc979ecd2024ada384698d33d25ac90", "ja": "（それぞれの夢に向かって。\nアイドル達は、これからも走り続けていくだろう）", "zh": "（相信这些偶像，\n今后也会朝着各自的梦想向前奔驰吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "d792b5852ac80f783333db2c6a7f084d5ab4cdfe8cb8ed99afb7df38ce187f85", "ja": "（夢見る乙女は、みんなプリンセス。\nいつかクイーンになることを目指す、お姫さまだ！）", "zh": "（怀有梦想的少女，每一位都是公主。\n她们都是终有一天，要成为女王的公主！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
